{"5043350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PUGAD", "steam_appid": 5043350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUGAD </strong>is a spearfishing horror game set on a secluded island in the Philippines. As a newbie diver, learn to hunt fish, upgrade your equipment, hone your diving skills, and discover what lurks in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make A Catch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/0ddeb04eb3efbf58162ff4971b65753c.poster.avif?t=1787773438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/0ddeb04eb3efbf58162ff4971b65753c.webm?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/0ddeb04eb3efbf58162ff4971b65753c.mp4?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty polespear and other gear to catch a wide variety of aquatic life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Record Your Catch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/623e7aa1e594764b8a96657841d5c15d.poster.avif?t=1787773438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/623e7aa1e594764b8a96657841d5c15d.webm?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/623e7aa1e594764b8a96657841d5c15d.mp4?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your journal to keep track everything of you've caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/f76b331fc835cdb7ccd1bbf3e032862a.poster.avif?t=1787773438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/f76b331fc835cdb7ccd1bbf3e032862a.webm?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/f76b331fc835cdb7ccd1bbf3e032862a.mp4?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your catch and spend your hard-earned money on better equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Improve Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/3b05c839d61f097bcd729795448d8de8.poster.avif?t=1787773438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/3b05c839d61f097bcd729795448d8de8.webm?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/3b05c839d61f097bcd729795448d8de8.mp4?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn mastery points from your travels and use them to improve skills and unlock new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face the Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/c152002f12d12e2a088a96a0cbf6d916.poster.avif?t=1787773438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/c152002f12d12e2a088a96a0cbf6d916.webm?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/c152002f12d12e2a088a96a0cbf6d916.mp4?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture across unique underwater environments and uncover what lies beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Creators</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize your gameplay by streaming, uploading gameplay videos, and/or making other types of broadcast content.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUGAD </strong>is a spearfishing horror game set on a secluded island in the Philippines. As a newbie diver, learn to hunt fish, upgrade your equipment, hone your diving skills, and discover what lurks in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make A Catch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/0ddeb04eb3efbf58162ff4971b65753c.poster.avif?t=1787773438\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043350/extras/0ddeb04eb3efbf58162ff4971b65753c.webm?t=1787773438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_